{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1f9ec4c7a5c37ea1cb149c9edd1a1915bc9102dd61f8f61dcb78cd5615aaa880", "ja": "（今回のBOT公演も、大好評で終了。\n劇場に、日常が戻ってきた）", "zh": "（这次BOT公演也在一片好评中结束了。剧场恢复了日常）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "00f94cdab2fc7c026f41393356bc524947326da355d328c5687214bcd6b117d8", "ja": "あら、{$P$}。\nちょうど良いところにいるじゃない。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}。\n你正好在这儿嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4a1d595eb28ea343924676158b9aee7a2970044318853028016d22ed1352836c", "ja": "お疲れ様。\n伊織は、レッスンが終わったところか？", "zh": "辛苦了。\n伊织刚结束训练吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "30ae09b9d1493f93d7e570cef4b77e73dca97c433b05479886bb2eb9b6354016", "ja": "ええ。育たちと一緒だったんだけど……\nあんた、この後時間ある？", "zh": "嗯。我刚才和育她们一起上完课……你接下来有时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c56e3d1a03df028eef21318a38d7d867d55ed9a8bbb66c6146cbd9e3bed5d7bb", "ja": "特に用事はないけど。\n何か、相談事か？", "zh": "没什么特别的事。\n是有什么想商量的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "0e8f8946672ebfa70ddb3cfa638b8058c830373ec5e4b95af76791f88ed10b05", "ja": "いいえ。でも、ある意味\n頼りたい……ってとこは、あってるかしら。", "zh": "不算是。不过，从某种意义上来说……\n想要依靠你，这点倒也没错呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "e4fe4c55448f329211359c4ea554912f152dffe95a8b61d9319dac992d8e18b0", "ja": "私たち、これから\nみんなでカフェにいくんだけど……。", "zh": "我们接下来\n打算大家一起去咖啡厅……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "94d8ec770aedfbabe15a291da020ad3d55e947601ebe7fbf9abdcc13c5497691", "ja": "駅からちょっと遠い場所だから、\nあんたに車で送ってもらえないかと思って。", "zh": "因为离车站有点远，所以想问问你能不能开车送我们过去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3ea416d5fde5f26594d3fd730bc9f79deff0a7f2dd888da28e67e310df62e9c6", "ja": "なんだ、そんな事か。構わない……というか、\n逆に、何か問題があるのか？", "zh": "什么嘛，就这点事啊。没关系……应该说，反过来讲，能有什么问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "12beb9724894e626251515332a7077c871b5c3e5af4456f1611244b0cc1456b4", "ja": "あるに決まってるでしょ！\n仕事じゃないのに、公私混同してるみたいじゃない。", "zh": "当然有了！\n明明又不是工作，这样不就显得公私不分了嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a4c2e6d2c278b79f6fb0b483900a643b7c56923632803dd18117bf4d44b5f94d", "ja": "皆、劇場でレッスンをして帰るところなんだから、\n仕事の帰りみたいなものだろ？　何も問題ないよ。", "zh": "大家都是在剧场练习完准备回去，和工作结束回去也没什么区别吧？没什么问题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "1c6c0e470a7acd1b8a85bd93aeb444d59e213e6118bc8868e17f143c96dd7332", "ja": "そ、そう？\nそれならいいけど……。", "zh": "是、是吗？\n那就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ac9fc9bd6efd07d26f3824860af200a86a965041297d566449cb63b9dba1ec2b", "ja": "まだ何かあるのか？", "zh": "还有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "18ac99217df18fbec20cddbc1a993ad47eb9bd41a32e76f90340548ad0c14c35", "ja": "別に、何もないわよ！　問題ないなら、\nさっさと私たちを連れていきなさーい！", "zh": "没什么，什么都没有！　既然没问题，就赶紧带我们过去——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0ec817af2bbc3a2125270d2e660ec7be2f544234da7489a85a204bb9b17267a0", "ja": "ああ、わかったよ。じゃあ車を用意してくるから、\n伊織は着替えを済ませてきてくれ。", "zh": "啊，我知道了。那我去准备车，伊织你先换好衣服过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "2b95f7dc73ffcd643975f0d9647b8261a3ab98212eec40a24b608d8f09b53cb1", "ja": "ええ、わかったわ。\nそれじゃ、15分後に劇場の裏でいい？", "zh": "嗯，知道了。\n那么，15分钟后在剧场后面见，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1016_007ior", "source_sha256": "69c06f5d4378e89b06bfbbca7674cd731c385620fa91f2f76d53450118543c4a", "ja": "あっ、15分じゃちょっと忙しいかしら。\n20分でもいいけど、育の帰りの時間があるし……。", "zh": "啊，15分钟的话，会不会有点赶？\n20分钟也可以，不过还要顾及育回去的时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1017_p", "source_sha256": "1bcb5a203a20ad0ae2672088c20c5e96bd45238e5d7a071c8ac2158d63bd1197", "ja": "15分でいいよ。育の帰りの時間まで\n気にしてくれてありがとう、伊織。", "zh": "15分钟就好。连育回家的时间\n都考虑到了，谢谢你，伊织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "ea77b6a48f0e4c5f1eb193883735cdb8171c80718a7a0ce8d92f65299104e12b", "ja": "あんた、私のことをなんだと思ってるのよ？\n年上だもの、これくらい当然でしょ。", "zh": "你以为我是什么人呀？\n我可是年长者，这点事理所当然吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "c964f1f0f82d6843ee2b9bacb04a6453c3d51785263b524b86251e6341d271c4", "ja": "それじゃ、お願いね。そうと決まれば、\nみんなにも知らせなくっちゃ。", "zh": "那就拜托你啦。既然这么决定了，也得通知大家才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0593_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0593_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "c8c61cf88f32c572d40e512cb077e1c48a55dee2fc0c308b5a094cb88abb4ba3", "ja": "あんたも、仕事は片付けてきなさいよ？\nどうせなら、みんなで楽しまないとでしょ。にひひ♪", "zh": "你也赶紧把工作处理完再来，听见没？既然要玩，就得大家一起享受才行吧。嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
